    headline: "Enough eye contact to connect, not enough to threaten",
    why: "Eye contact has an inverted-U relationship with trust. Too little reads as evasive or ashamed; too much reads as dominance or threat. The workable band in most Western professional contexts is roughly sixty to seventy percent while speaking, and more while listening. Knowing the number turns an anxious abstraction into a measurable behaviour.",
