    why: "Attunement is automatic: two people in conversation converge in pace, posture and breathing within minutes, and whoever is more regulated sets the tempo. That is a gift in ordinary conversation and a hazard in conflict, because the instinct to match energy means an angry person will pull you up to their tempo if you let them.",
